☐ One secondary gap found (same class of bug, FS side): Hook_NtQueryInformationFile — class 21 (FileAllInformation) is not handled. It embeds a FILE_NAME_INFORMATION at a fixed offset of 96 bytes that would return a virtual-store volume-relative path. The existing class 9 code already applies ReverseApplyFsRedirect using the same pattern, so class 21 needs the exact same treatment. Class 48 (FileNormalizedNameInformation) has a different format (device path, not volume-relative) so ReverseApplyFsRedirect can't handle it without deeper changes — I'll note it but leave it alone. https://claude.ai/chat/4a7f5ba9-bcdd-4314-a8e7-55395551d219   badr2351

